Swaps the [b]Dart Rifle[/b] for a [b]VSS Vintorez[/b]. You buy it in the same place, it sits in the same slot.

[list]
[*][b]Semi-automatic, ten rounds[/b], using sniper rifle ammo instead of darts.[/*]
[*][b]Still a quiet stealth gun[/b]: it hits as hard as the Dart Rifle did, and it doesn't put anyone to sleep.[/*]
[*][b]It can jam and break[/b] like the Dragunov, so keep it clean.[/*]
[*][b]Its own model, textures, icons and shot sound.[/b][/*]
[*][b]With Aiming Overhaul[/b] installed, its scope gets the Dragunov's PSO-1 reticle. Optional.[/*]
[/list]
[b]Heads up:[/b] it borrows the Dragunov's animations, so the hands don't sit perfectly on the gun.

[size=4][b]How to install (Vortex)[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/about/vortex/]Vortex[/url] and its [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/site/mods/2143]Far Cry 2 extension[/url].[/*]
[*]Click [b]Mod Manager Download[/b] on this page and enable the mod.[/*]
[*]Start the game with the [b]Play[/b] button in Vortex.[/*]
[/list]
Not using Vortex? Add the zip in [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/farcry2/mods/370]JackAll[/url] instead.

[b]Already own a Dart Rifle in your save? Buy it again.[/b] The one you already have keeps its old behaviour under the new look.

[size=4][b]Make your own[/b][/size]
How this was built, step by step, so you can do the same to any other weapon: [url=https://jbebe.github.io/farcry-sdk/docs/modding/replacing-a-weapon]Replacing an existing weapon[/url].

